  "body": "A generously proportioned family-friendly house near to schools and shops and boasting a freehold corner site.\r\n\r\nBuilt with a cavity system, our motivated sellers also have a building report and LIM report at the ready for your peace of mind and ease of buying. A hard home to beat for the whanau needing room to move and to entertain in comfort.\r\n\r\nA sunny spot in the street with a gorgeous, elevated outlook, expansive decks, fully fenced garden, garage, and off- street parking, this home will make sense for both your family’s needs and your bank balance.\r\n\r\nThe location is superb being so close to all amenities, the week-daily ferry service to the C.B.D, cafes, scenic walks, marina, Golf courses and the many quiet safe beaches and parks the beautiful Whangaparaoa Peninsula offers in abundance.\r\n\r\nThis property has been a rental investment for our owners of two decades meeting healthy home requirements and has been well cared for, just recently having a brand-new family bathroom. There is still scope however for you to further modernise and make it more your own if you so wished.\r\n\r\nIt’s the complete family package and you absolutely should see this one.",
